1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:08,046
Allopolyploidy: its sets come from two different species, Raphanus sativus and Brassica oleracea.

2
00:00:08,046 --> 00:00:13,515
Autopolyploidy is the trap, but that multiplies the sets of a single species.

3
00:00:13,515 --> 00:00:18,841
Monosomy and trisomy change single chromosomes, not sets.

